│                                                                                                                      │
│ Filter                                                                                                               │
│ type                      Narrows as you type; all words match                                                       │
│ enter                     Keep the filter, move around again                                                         │
│ esc                       Clear the filter                                                                           │
│ /                         Change the filter                                                                          │
│                           The agenda searches a year ahead and                                                       │
